WEBVTT

00:00:57.178 --> 00:01:00.598
And the decision of where
that money is going

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:02.934
included all of our voices.

00:01:04.685 --> 00:01:07.563
This is a giving circle:

00:01:07.605 --> 00:01:09.774
a group of people with shared values

00:01:09.774 --> 00:01:12.110
that comes together to create change.

00:01:13.778 --> 00:01:15.321
My giving circle,

00:01:15.363 --> 00:01:17.073
the Peninsula Latina Giving Circle,

00:01:17.073 --> 00:01:19.408
is what I know philanthropy to be.

00:01:19.951 --> 00:01:21.202
It's joyful.

00:01:22.036 --> 00:01:23.830
And transformative

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:26.332
and collaborative and intentional.

00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:30.586
Most people don't see us
as philanthropists